`,e.jsxs(i.p,{children:[e.jsx(i.strong,{children:"Description:"})," Splitting a region, how long to wait on the file-splitting step before aborting the attempt. Default: 600000. This setting used to be known as hbase.regionserver.fileSplitTimeout in hbase-1.x. Split is now run master-side hence the rename (If a 'hbase.master.fileSplitTimeout' setting found, will use it to prime the current 'hbase.master.fileSplitTimeout' Configuration.",e.jsx(i.br,{}),`
`,e.jsx(i.strong,{children:"Default:"})," ",e.jsx(i.code,{children:"600000"})]}),`
