`,e.jsxs(i.p,{children:["Set HBase environment variables in this file. Examples include options to pass the JVM on start of an HBase daemon such as heap size and garbage collector configs. You can also set configurations for HBase configuration, log directories, niceness, ssh options, where to locate process pid files, etc. Open the file at ",e.jsx(i.em,{children:"conf/hbase-env.sh"})," and peruse its content. Each option is fairly well documented. Add your own environment variables here if you want them read by HBase daemons on startup."]}),`
