`,e.jsx(i.h2,{id:"rpc-connection-registry-new-as-of-250",children:"Rpc Connection Registry (new as of 2.5.0)"}),`
`,e.jsxs(i.p,{children:["As said in the ",e.jsx(i.a,{href:"/docs/architecture/client#masterregistry-rpc-hedging",children:"Master Registry (new as of 2.3.0)"})," section, there are some disadvantages and limitations for MasterRegistry, especially that it puts master in the critical path of read/write operations. In order to address these problems, we introduced a more generic RpcConnectionRegistry."]}),`
