`,e.jsxs(i.li,{children:["Each ",e.jsx(i.code,{children:"StoreScanner"})," object further contains a list of ",e.jsx(i.code,{children:"StoreFileScanner"})," objects, corresponding to each StoreFile and HFile of the corresponding column family, and a list of ",e.jsx(i.code,{children:"KeyValueScanner"})," objects for the MemStore."]}),`
