`,e.jsx(i.li,{children:"If we enable this feature, some master operations such as grant, revoke, snapshot... (See the design doc for more details) will be slower as we need to sync HDFS ACLs to related hfiles."}),`
`,e.jsxs(i.li,{children:["HDFS has a config which limits the max ACL entries num for one directory or file:",`
