`,e.jsxs(i.p,{children:["It is important to drain HBase regions slowly when restarting multiple RegionServers. Otherwise, multiple regions go offline simultaneously and must be reassigned to other nodes, which may also go offline soon. This can negatively affect performance. You can inject delays into the script above, for instance, by adding a Shell command such as ",e.jsx(i.code,{children:"sleep"}),". To wait for 5 minutes between each RegionServer restart, modify the above script to the following:"]}),`
