`,e.jsxs(i.p,{children:["While creating a snapshot, if TTL in seconds is not explicitly specified, the above logic will be followed to determine the TTL. If no configs are changed, the default behavior is that all snapshots will be retained forever (until manual deletion). If a different default TTL behavior is desired, ",e.jsx(i.code,{children:"hbase.master.snapshot.ttl"})," can be set to a default TTL in seconds. Any snapshot created without an explicit TTL will take this new value."]}),`
