`,e.jsx(i.p,{children:"Along the top-bar on the Master, you can now find a 'Procedures&Locks' tab which takes you to a page that is ugly but useful. It dumps currently running procedures and framework locks. Look at this when you can't figure what stuff is stuck; it will at least identify problematic procedures (take the pid and grep the logs...). Look for ROLLEDBACK or pids that have been RUNNING for a long time."}),`
