`,e.jsxs(i.p,{children:["Not really. SQL-ish support for HBase via ",e.jsx(i.a,{href:"https://hive.apache.org/",children:"Hive"})," is in development, however Hive is based on MapReduce which is not generally suitable for low-latency requests. See the ",e.jsx(i.a,{href:"/docs/datamodel",children:"Data Model"})," section for examples on the HBase client."]}),`
